WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:01.536
Oh no!

2
00:00:02.287 --> 00:00:07.310
A mountain of crumpled papers, and Maya has to copy every little drawing by hand!

3
00:00:08.060 --> 00:00:11.327
Welcome back to Cloud Town, high up in the sky!

4
00:00:12.078 --> 00:00:14.460
This is Episode 93.

5
00:00:15.210 --> 00:00:17.203
Meet the scanner window.

6
00:00:17.954 --> 00:00:20.065
Hold a paper behind it.

7
00:00:20.815 --> 00:00:25.036
The light sweeps down, and every drawing pops out as a clean card.

8
00:00:25.787 --> 00:00:28.122
Drawings in boxes and rows?

9
00:00:28.872 --> 00:00:31.337
They come out in boxes and rows.

10
00:00:32.088 --> 00:00:33.822
Wrinkled and stained?

11
00:00:34.572 --> 00:00:37.590
It looks twice, and still gets them all.

12
00:00:38.341 --> 00:00:42.032
Feed it the whole pile, and the cards stack themselves.

13
00:00:42.782 --> 00:00:45.200
That is Amazon Textract.

14
00:00:45.951 --> 00:00:50.349
It reads papers and pulls out the words, numbers and tables for you.

15
00:00:51.099 --> 00:00:53.364
Now you know the scanner window!

16
00:00:54.115 --> 00:00:57.700
See you next time in Cloud Town, high up in the sky!

